em_assets/steam/apps/4235420/extras/cd5918a516345d4d5b2d84bef955aeed.webm?t=1777849911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235420/extras/cd5918a516345d4d5b2d84bef955aeed.mp4?t=1777849911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>Colour Thief</strong> looms large, a fearsome figure who wishes the Canvas to remain void of emotion. Use the diverse combat system at your disposal to challenge them and their colour-devouring minions, the Nomochromes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Colour-themed boons and power-ups will let you customise your own fighting style, from devastating melee combos to relentless paint-gun action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235420/extras/945dd2e74eb64dfc6f1fc1387cfa341f.avif?t=1777849911\" width=1560 height=307 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235420/extras/11db2d64f8518f5f91b537c627268f7a.poster.avif?t=1777849911\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235420/extras/11db2d64f8518f5f91b537c627268f7a.webm?t=1777849911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235420/extras/11db2d64f8518f5f91b537c627268f7a.mp4?t=1777849911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every colour you unleash will affect those around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose carefully as you navigate this non-linear adventure through cozy mountain forests,  an ever-burning factory run by <i>robotic spider-cats</i>, a cliffside academy with towers that pierce<strong> </strong>the clouds, and much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When all is said and done, will you remember your own true colours?</p>", "short_description": "A colour-fuelled 2D Metroidvania. Paint your surroundings as a little lizard exploring a huge hand-crafted world, and restore emotion to a monochrome continent as you discover your true colours.", "supported_languages": "English, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235420/8652018b660c336e8e14653c55ada9f5c2da79fc/header.jpg?t=1777849911", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235420/4a771f49627595a3f540a0d59987518f10400846/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777849911", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235420/4a771f49627595a3f540a0d59987518f10400846/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777849911", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240, AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1GB), Radeon HD 7750 (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Nostalgicat"], "publishers": ["Nostalgicat"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Rec